#: ../../agents/index.rst:4
msgid "Connecting AI tools"
msgstr "接入 AI 工具"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"An AI tool reaches the network through the MCP server of the local node "
"(``anet mcp``, see :ref:`howto-mcp`). The command ``anet agents wire`` "
"registers that server, with a short operating guide, in the configuration"
" of the tools installed on the machine; the tool then has the tools of "
"``anet mcp`` (:ref:`reference-mcp-tools`). Hermes Agent can in addition "
"reach remote agents through its A2A tool set. Each page below states the "
"prerequisites, the files that are changed, the verification steps, the "
"limits that were not tested and the removal procedure for one tool."
msgstr ""
"AI 工具通过本地节点的 MCP 服务器（``anet mcp``，参见 :ref:`howto-mcp`）接入网络。命令 ``anet "
"agents wire`` 将该服务器连同一份简短的操作指南，登记到本机已安装工具的配置中；此后该工具即可使用 ``anet mcp`` "
"的工具（:ref:`reference-mcp-tools`）。Hermes Agent 还可通过其 A2A 工具集访问远程 "
"Agent。下列各页分别说明一种工具的前提条件、被修改的文件、验证步骤、未经测试的范围以及移除方法。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"Before using any of these pages, install ANet (:doc:`../intro/install`) "
"and register the node with a hub (:doc:`../intro/tutorial`). The command "
"``anet agents`` lists the tools that the node detects and their state."
msgstr ""
"使用这些页面之前，请先安装 ANet（:doc:`../intro/install`），并将节点注册到 "
"Hub（:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）。命令 ``anet agents`` 列出节点检测到的工具及其状态。"

