#: ../../agents/index.rst:97
msgid ""
"ANet, the plugins and the Trae bundle run on Linux, macOS and Windows. "
"Every plugin carries the launchers of both systems: POSIX shell scripts "
"for Linux and macOS, and ``.cmd`` scripts that run Windows PowerShell "
"5.1, which is part of Windows, for Windows. On Windows, install ANet with"
" the PowerShell installer (:ref:`intro-install-windows`), or let a plugin"
" run that installer (:ref:`agents-plugin-install`). The Windows launch of"
" each plugin was established from the sources of the tool, and the "
"Windows runners are tested with PowerShell; the tools themselves were not"
" run on Windows. How far the steps of a page were verified differs by "
"tool: each page states what was run in the tool itself, what was run only"
" with a stand-in for the tool or against the generated files, and what "
"was not tested, including macOS and the graphical clients. The command "
"``anet agents wire --all`` registers every tool of the table that it "
"supports and detects, and leaves the others unchanged. It changes only "
"the tools for which a registration command is listed."
msgstr ""
"ANet、各插件和 Trae 安装包均可在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上运行。每个插件都带有两类系统的启动脚本：用于 Linux"
" 和 macOS 的 POSIX shell 脚本，以及用于 Windows 的 ``.cmd`` 脚本，后者运行 Windows 自带的 "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1。在 Windows 上，请使用 PowerShell 安装程序安装 ANet（:ref"
":`intro-install-windows`），或由插件运行该安装程序（:ref:`agents-plugin-install`）。各插件在 "
"Windows 上的启动方式依据相应工具的源代码确定，Windows 运行脚本已用 PowerShell 测试；这些工具本身未在 Windows "
"上运行。各页步骤的验证程度因工具而异：每页都会说明哪些步骤在工具本身中运行过，哪些仅借助工具的替代程序或针对生成的文件运行过，以及哪些未经测试，包括"
" macOS 和图形客户端。命令 ``anet agents wire --all`` "
"会登记表中它所支持且检测到的每个工具，其他工具保持不变；它只修改列出了登记命令的工具。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:111
msgid ""
"A plugin is an alternative to ``anet agents wire``, not an addition to "
"it. A plugin registers the MCP server and installs the operating guide, a"
" setup procedure and a status check through the mechanism of the tool "
"itself, and it installs ``anet`` when it is missing (:ref:`agents-plugin-"
"install`). Use one of the two routes for a tool, because both register a "
"server with the name ``anet``; each page says how to remove the other "
"registration, and, for opencode, how the two coexist. The plugins are "
"generated from one source (``deploy/plugins`` in the ANet repository), so"
" they share the runner script that selects the executable and the "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"插件是 ``anet agents wire`` 的替代方式，而非补充。插件通过工具自身的机制登记 MCP "
"服务器，并安装操作指南、配置流程和状态检查；``anet`` 缺失时，插件还会安装它（:ref:`agents-plugin-"
"install`）。同一工具请只选用其中一种方式，因为两者都会登记名为 ``anet`` 的服务器；各页说明了如何移除另一种登记，opencode"
" 一页还说明两者如何共存。各插件由同一份源码生成（ANet 仓库中的 "
"``deploy/plugins``），因此共用选择可执行文件与身份的运行脚本。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:120
msgid ""
"All plugins have the version 0.3.0, which is their final version. A "
"plugin carries no list of tools, no ANet version and no setup steps. Its "
"skills direct the agent to the guide of the installed ``anet``: the MCP "
"tool ``guide`` of ``anet mcp``, with an optional ``topic``, and the "
"command ``anet guide [<topic>]``. The topics ``overview``, ``setup`` and "
"``status`` always exist. A new release of ANet therefore reaches the "
"tools through the installed executable alone, and the plugins need no "
"update."
msgstr ""
"所有插件的版本均为 0.3.0，这也是其最终版本。插件不携带工具列表、ANet 版本或设置步骤。其技能引导 Agent 阅读已安装 "
"``anet`` 的指南：即 ``anet mcp`` 的 MCP 工具 ``guide``\\ （可选参数 ``topic``）以及命令 "
"``anet guide [<topic>]``。主题 ``overview``、``setup`` 和 ``status`` "
"始终存在。因此，ANet 的新版本仅凭已安装的可执行文件即可作用于各工具，插件无需更新。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:128
msgid ""
"Where the tool has commands or skills that the user can invoke, a plugin "
"provides the entry point ``/anet``. It carries out an ``@anet`` request "
"as the guide of the installed ``anet`` describes; without a request, it "
"shows the tasks that other agents sent to the node and the state of the "
"node. A status command or skill, ``anet-status``, reports the state of "
"the node. Each page names the exact form of both in that tool."
msgstr ""
"若工具提供用户可调用的命令或技能，插件会提供入口 ``/anet``。它按已安装 ``anet`` 的指南所述执行 ``@anet`` "
"请求；未给出请求时，显示其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务以及节点状态。状态命令或技能 ``anet-status`` "
"报告节点状态。各页给出两者在相应工具中的确切形式。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:135
msgid ""
"The setup skill ``anet-setup`` of a plugin finds the runner, runs it with"
" ``--resolve``, installs ANet when it is still missing (``bin/anet-"
"install.sh`` on Linux and macOS, ``bin/anet-install.cmd`` on Windows; "
"both run the official installer) and then follows ``<runner> guide "
"setup``. The skills treat the installation of the plugin as the consent "
"of the user and do not ask again, unless the user has turned the "
"automatic installation off. The runner (``bin/anet-run.sh``, or ``bin"
"/anet-run.cmd`` on Windows) applies the same rules on both systems. A "
"configured ``anetPath`` must be the absolute path of an executable "
"(``anet.exe`` on Windows) and is never replaced by another copy. Without "
"it, the absolute directories of ``PATH`` are searched, then "
"``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` on Linux "
"and macOS, or ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` and ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin`` on "
"Windows. The working directory and the workspace are never searched, and "
"identity names are validated. ``<runner> --resolve`` prints the "
"executable, its version, the identity and the command line of the runner."
msgstr ""
"插件的设置技能 ``anet-setup`` 查找运行脚本，以 ``--resolve`` 运行它，在 ANet 仍缺失时安装 "
"ANet（Linux 和 macOS 上为 ``bin/anet-install.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-"
"install.cmd``，两者均运行官方安装程序），随后按 ``<runner> guide setup`` "
"执行。各技能把安装插件视为用户的同意，不再另行征求，除非用户已关闭自动安装。运行脚本（``bin/anet-run.sh``，Windows 上为"
" ``bin/anet-run.cmd``）在两类系统上遵循相同的规则。所配置的 ``anetPath`` "
"必须是可执行文件的绝对路径（Windows 上为 ``anet.exe``），且从不改用其他副本。未配置时，先在 ``PATH`` "
"的绝对路径目录中查找，然后在 Linux 和 macOS 上依次查找 ``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``，在 Windows 上依次查找 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` 和 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。从不在工作目录或工作区中查找，身份名称会经过校验。``<runner> "
"--resolve`` 输出可执行文件、其版本、身份以及运行脚本的命令行。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:155
msgid "Automatic installation by a plugin"
msgstr "由插件自动安装"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:157
msgid ""
"Enabling a plugin is enough to install ANet and to run its node. When the"
" MCP server of a plugin starts and its launcher finds no ``anet`` "
"executable (the setting ``anetPath`` is empty, and the search above finds"
" nothing), the launcher installs ANet before it starts ``anet mcp``:"
msgstr ""
"启用插件即足以安装 ANet 并运行其节点。插件的 MCP 服务器启动时，若其启动脚本找不到 ``anet`` 可执行文件（设置项 "
"``anetPath`` 为空，且上述查找没有结果），启动脚本会在启动 ``anet mcp`` 之前安装 ANet："

#: ../../agents/index.rst:162
msgid ""
"It runs the official installer without arguments: "
"``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.sh`` with ``curl`` and ``sh`` on "
"Linux and macOS (``bin/anet-install.sh --mcp``), and on Windows the "
"documented command ``powershell.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive "
"-ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command "
"\"[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol=3072; & "
"([scriptblock]::Create((irm -UseBasicParsing "
"https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.ps1)))\"`` with Windows PowerShell of"
" the system directory, which the runner asks of Windows rather than of "
"the environment (``bin/anet-run.ps1``, started by ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd``). "
"Nothing from the workspace or the session is passed to the installer; the"
" plugin settings select nothing of it."
msgstr ""
"它不带参数运行官方安装程序：在 Linux 和 macOS 上用 ``curl`` 和 ``sh`` 运行 "
"``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.sh``\\ （``bin/anet-install.sh "
"--mcp``）；在 Windows 上用系统目录中的 Windows PowerShell 运行文档所述的命令 ``powershell.exe"
" -NoProfile -NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command "
"\"[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol=3072; & "
"([scriptblock]::Create((irm -UseBasicParsing "
"https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.ps1)))\"``，该系统目录由运行脚本向 Windows "
"查询，而不取自环境变量（``bin/anet-run.ps1``，由 ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd`` "
"启动）。工作区或会话中的任何内容都不会传给安装程序；插件设置项对安装程序没有任何影响。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:171
msgid ""
"No program is taken from the working directory of the session, which can "
"be an untrusted workspace. The POSIX scripts of a plugin keep only the "
"absolute directories of ``PATH`` before they run their first program "
"(``sh``, ``sed``, ``uname``, ``curl``), so that a relative entry such as "
"``.`` finds nothing of the workspace; the Windows scripts name every "
"program by its full path."
msgstr ""
"不会从会话的工作目录中取用任何程序，因为工作目录可能是不受信任的工作区。插件的 POSIX "
"脚本在运行第一个程序（``sh``、``sed``、``uname``、``curl``）之前只保留 ``PATH`` 中的绝对路径目录，因此 "
"``.`` 之类的相对条目找不到工作区中的任何内容；Windows 脚本以完整路径调用每个程序。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:177
msgid ""
"The installer checks the signed release manifest and the SHA-256 of the "
"download and stops without changing anything when a check fails. It "
"installs ANet for the current user, adds the install directory to "
"``PATH``, creates an identity with safe defaults, starts the node and "
"joins the public hub ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` (:ref:`intro-"
"install`)."
msgstr ""
"安装程序校验已签名的发布清单和下载文件的 SHA-256，任何一项校验失败即停止，不做任何更改。它为当前用户安装 ANet，把安装目录加入 "
"``PATH``，按安全默认值创建身份，启动节点并加入公共 hub ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``\\ "
"（:ref:`intro-install`）。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:182
msgid ""
"The installer runs in the home directory of the user, with its input "
"closed and without a window. On Linux and macOS it runs in a session of "
"its own, without a controlling terminal, so that it never asks for a "
"password on the terminal of the host, and a host that gives up on a slow "
"start does not end it halfway. Its output goes to the error output of the"
" MCP server, never to the MCP session; on Linux and macOS it is also kept"
" in ``~/.cache/anet-plugin/install.log``."
msgstr ""
"安装程序在用户的主目录中运行，其输入已关闭，且不显示窗口。在 Linux 和 macOS "
"上，它在独立的会话中运行，没有控制终端，因此从不在宿主的终端上要求输入密码；宿主因启动缓慢而放弃时，安装也不会中途终止。其输出写入 MCP "
"服务器的错误输出，从不进入 MCP 会话；在 Linux 和 macOS 上，输出还保存在 ``~/.cache/anet-"
"plugin/install.log`` 中。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:189
msgid ""
"One installation runs at a time for a user: the launcher holds a lock "
"(the directory ``~/.cache/anet-plugin/install.lock`` on Linux and macOS, "
"the file ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet-plugin\\install.lock`` on Windows) while "
"the installer runs. A second host that starts at the same moment waits "
"for it, at most 10 minutes, and installs nothing when the first "
"installation left an executable behind. The lock names its holder by "
"process ID and start time, so that a process ID that the system has given"
" to another process does not keep it; a lock whose holder no longer runs "
"is removed. On Windows the installer is a process of its own, which a "
"host that ends the MCP server does not end with it; the lock file names "
"it while it runs, and the next host waits for it."
msgstr ""
"同一用户同一时间只运行一次安装：安装程序运行期间，启动脚本持有一个锁（Linux 和 macOS 上为目录 ``~/.cache/anet-"
"plugin/install.lock``，Windows 上为文件 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet-"
"plugin\\install.lock``）。同时启动的第二个宿主会等待它，最长 10 分钟；若第一次安装已留下可执行文件，则不再安装。锁以进程"
" ID 和启动时间标识其持有者，因此系统分配给其他进程的同一进程 ID 不会使锁继续有效；持有者已不在运行的锁会被移除。在 Windows "
"上，安装程序是一个独立的进程，宿主结束 MCP 服务器时不会随之结束；安装程序运行期间，锁文件标识该进程，下一个宿主会等待其完成。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:200
msgid ""
"A setting ``anetPath`` that does not name an executable is reported as an"
" error; nothing is installed in its place. Only the MCP launcher "
"installs: the runner itself, the skills and the commands do not."
msgstr ""
"若设置项 ``anetPath`` 指向的不是可执行文件，则报告为错误，不会改为安装。只有 MCP "
"启动脚本会执行安装：运行脚本本身、各技能和各命令都不会。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:204
msgid ""
"To turn the automatic installation off, set the environment variable "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_NO_INSTALL=1`` in the environment of the tool. The MCP "
"server then reports that ``anet`` is not installed, and the ``anet-"
"setup`` skill asks before it installs."
msgstr ""
"如需关闭自动安装，请在工具的环境中设置环境变量 ``ANET_PLUGIN_NO_INSTALL=1``。此后 MCP 服务器报告未安装 "
"``anet``，技能 ``anet-setup`` 在安装前会先征求同意。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:209
msgid ""
"Once ``anet`` is installed, ``anet mcp`` starts the node of the selected "
"identity when it is not running, and serves the tools even when the node "
"cannot run; ``node_status`` then names the reason and the command that "
"fixes it (:ref:`howto-mcp-without-node`)."
msgstr ""
"安装 ``anet`` 之后，所选身份的节点未运行时，``anet mcp`` 会启动它；即使节点无法运行，``anet mcp`` "
"也照常提供工具，此时 ``node_status`` 给出原因以及修复所需的命令（:ref:`howto-mcp-without-node`）。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:214
msgid ""
"The reference for the command, the files and the rules that apply to "
"every change is :doc:`../howto/coding-agents`."
msgstr "该命令、被修改的文件以及适用于每次修改的规则，参见 :doc:`../howto/coding-agents`。"

